    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_select_01",
      "hash64": "84589E7D23A65B06",
      "text": "¡Impresionante!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_select_02",
      "hash64": "84589D7D23A65953",
      "text": "Qué curioso...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_04",
      "hash64": "9A4E4DC60C312691",
      "text": "¡Ya sabía yo que compartirías mi vena teatral!\\n¡Ja, ja, ja![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_05",
      "hash64": "9A4E4CC60C3124DE",
      "text": "En esta ocasión no creo que haga falta poner a\\nprueba la resistencia de mis piernas, ¡pues seguro\\r\\nque nuestro combate será una obra magistral![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_06",
      "hash64": "9A4E4BC60C31232B",
      "text": "Somos personas tan expresivas que las palabras\\nentre nosotros sobran. ¡Que hable el arte![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_07",
      "hash64": "9A4E4AC60C312178",
      "text": "¿Estás preparad[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa? ¡Pues dejemos volar nuestra\\nimaginación y creemos nuestra obra conjunta![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_08",
      "hash64": "9A4E49C60C311FC5",
      "text": "En combate, me recuerdas a un original y\\nfluctuante degradado de tonalidades variables.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_09",
      "hash64": "9A4E48C60C311E12",
      "text": "Un trazo violento pero calmado. ¡Me quito el\\nsombrero ante tal indescriptible contraste![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_10",
      "hash64": "9A4ACBC60C2E13D4",
      "text": "Los combates que libro contra ti son exquisitos.\\c\\nMe hacen recordar lo que sentí cuando el arte\\nirrumpió en mi vida.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_11",
      "hash64": "9A4ACCC60C2E1587",
      "text": "A todo esto, habías venido a petición de la\\nSupercampeona para una inspección, ¿no?[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_12",
      "hash64": "9A4ACDC60C2E173A",
      "text": "Bueno, pues ya verás tú lo que le dices.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_13",
      "hash64": "9A4ACEC60C2E18ED",
      "text": "Oooh, ¡de nuevo me invade la inspiración![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_14",
      "hash64": "9A4AC7C60C2E0D08",
      "text": "Lo lamento, pero mi nueva creación me reclama.\\nAsí que perdóname, ¡pero hasta otra![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
